  "body": "## Highlight\r\n\r\n* This release fixes tty crashes when using `CustomGraphics`/`CustomOutput` introduced in 1.2.\r\n* Also done a major cleanup of the codebase to simplify many things.\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Cleanup by @sayanarijit in https://github.com/sayanarijit/xplr/pull/794\r\n* Fix tty crash when rendering graphics by @sayanarijit in https://github.com/sayanarijit/xplr/pull/795\r\n* Rendered image quality will not be rich due to some simplification, but will be there eventually.\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/sayanarijit/xplr/compare/v1.2.1...v1.2.2",
